<title>USA: AmerTranz restructuring, closing subsidiary.</title>
<headline>AmerTranz restructuring, closing subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE SUCCESS, N.Y. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>AmerTranz Worldwide Holding Corp said Tuesday it is restructuring its operations and closing its AmerTranz Worldwide Inc unit.</p>
<p>The freight forwarding services company said it ceased operations of AmerTranz Worldwide effective June 23. It said the subsidiary has incurred operating losses that will exceed $6 million in the fiscal year ended June 30.</p>
<p>AmerTranz said its Target Air Freight subsidiary will deliver all outstanding shipments and provide services to former customers of AmerTranz Worldwide.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
